{"id":"wb-5-311","name":"永昌堡","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永昌堡","text":"永昌堡位于浙江省温州市龙湾区永中街道，建于明代嘉靖三十七年（公元1558年），是民间出资兴建的抗倭城堡。2001年，永昌堡作为浙江目前仅存的民建古城堡被中国国务院列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E6%98%8C%E5%A0%A1","revisionId":92292966,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92292966","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/88ada7e841ba85786399f17d.jpg","title":"永昌堡国保立碑（都堂第）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B0%B8%E6%98%8C%E5%A0%A1%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%AB%8B%E7%A2%91%EF%BC%88%E9%83%BD%E5%A0%82%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/%E6%B0%B8%E6%98%8C%E5%A0%A1%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%AB%8B%E7%A2%91%EF%BC%88%E9%83%BD%E5%A0%82%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​永昌堡国保立碑（都堂第）。","width":320,"height":213}}